{
  "_id": "FnU8ED7Lc1FVMjHX",
  "name": "Twin Blades of Azzinoth",
  "type": "weapon",
  "img": "icons/weapons/swords/scimitar-guard-brown.webp",
  "folder": "k5SXmlVACc2CKVy0",
  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This pair of demonic warglaives once belonged to Azzinoth, an ancient doomguard commander of the Burning Legion. Illidan Stormrage slew him millennia ago during the War of the Ancients and reforged the blades for himself, so that he could turn fel magic against the demons of the Legion.</p><p><strong>Magic Weapons.</strong> You gain a +3 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with these magic weapons. Each deals an extra 2d8 Psychic damage to a Fiend; this damage ignores Resistance and Immunity.</p><p><strong>Fel Synchronization.</strong> If you hit the same creature with both weapons on a turn, it makes a DC 18 Wisdom saving throw immediately after the second weapon hits. On a failure, it is racked by fel magic and has the Stunned condition until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Flames of Azzinoth.</strong> As a Magic action, you can throw one of the weapons to an unoccupied space on the ground you can see within 30 feet of you. The blade becomes a fiery green fiend as if you had cast @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.veN6IiVn4zwHM7r9]{Summon Fiend} (Devil option). The spell lasts for 1 minute, and when the fiend disappears, the weapon reappears in your hand. You can't turn that weapon into a Fiend again until 7 days have passed.</p><p><strong>Random Properties.</strong> This Artifact has the following random properties (see <em>Artifact Traits</em> in the module journal): 1 minor beneficial property, 1 major beneficial property, 1 minor detrimental property.</p><p><strong>Destroying the Blades.</strong> Reciting an ancient poem called \"Gift of the Light\" over the blades dissolves them into glittering dust. The poem is mostly lost to time, though a few rare naaru remember it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-zzqODI4kyu22XpUm\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The item is the pair (quantity 2). Restore the use of Flames of Azzinoth after 7 days.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
